    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk... Those are the same goons as last time\u2014 How'd they find us here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up and retreat! Don't waste time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They've got us surrounded. And outnumbered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we gotta find a way to break through!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their scouts took out all our sentries. We're in the dark here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bullshit! Are you gonna stand around and wait for their Casters to fry you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you... You're with Hoederer... What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Hoederer? And his men? He's supposed to be\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bottlebroken",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what are you doing to my comms?! What gives\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Would you shut up already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember how I was on patrol here? That made it real easy to plant bombs all over your camp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You! Hoederer! You sold us out...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make it sound so bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're headed out on a long, long trip. And wouldn't you know it? Some guests showed up just as we're leaving. So someone's gotta stay behind to hold the fort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now if we leave some snacks out for our guests like a good host, maybe that'll get them to stop chasing us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gotta say, I appreciate all you're doing for us~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn you... You knew they were coming the whole time... And you're just going to leave us here to die\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
