    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I ordered you to help the teams that didn't have time to escape, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why didn't anyone else make it out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They volunteered to stay behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. I left them a little gift... So they were more than happy to help us hold off the bad guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I doubt anyone here would be willing to sacrifice themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to lie about it. Nobody's going to blame you for sacrificing others to save your own squad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "But lying to your commander is another story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't fool my eyes, W. You're on thin ice here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget how green you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll be sure to reflect upon my actions, Captain Ines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because we'll be working together... for a very long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what's the plan now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No harm, no foul. What's done is done, and it was probably going to turn out like this anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "W might have made the right call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do you seriously believe that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz over there have nothing to do with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who they were, what they did. How they lived, how they died. None of our business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Brutal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's talk work first. Ines, you and W split up and lead your teams away. Messengers stay radio silent, then regroup at the rendezvous point.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll catch up later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "...One more thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care what kind of mischief you get up to, how one of you exploits the other or whatever, but I won't stand for you actually, directly fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "But indirectly is fine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pretty lax rules.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really hope it doesn't come to that. But it's not like I could stop it either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "For now, at least, if you plan to stay alive, make good use of every last Sarkaz you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer has always been like this."
    },
    {
        "text": "He thinks very little about what actually matters, and wastes so much brainpower on the pointless stuff."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nobody says W isn't a great fighter. But there's a lot she's missing."
    },
    {
        "text": "If she really is just an incredible Sarkaz warrior..."
    },
    {
        "text": "....Hmph."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
