    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not even dark out. And you still gotta hide over here by the fire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you just like fire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I definitely don't like people bothering me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your team is three hours late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That ambush... did you and Hoederer plan that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ask him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He doesn't know anything about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Then it must've been a coincidence. All mercs are a pain in the ass to deal with. You cross their path, and they're gonna give you shit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's all? Here I was worried Hoederer sold out my position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You think that's what he should've done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know we're not lying to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You could've killed me a long time ago. Doing it now wouldn't help much, would it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "What were you doing before you found us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? After all we've been through, you're giving me the job interview now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer never asks about his people's pasts. But I'm not Hoederer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah you're a whole different species from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you looking for trouble here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As far as I can tell, 'Miss Ines' isn't so good at close combat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
