    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "A lesson for you: If you want to live a little longer, don't put all your eggs in one basket.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every Sarkaz mercenary carries a sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well color me surprised. All this time I thought that was your staff. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Oh, but you, a 'Sarkaz mercenary?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Tch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm still pretty sure I've got you beat at close range, but... Hmm, I admit I got a little careless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, thanks. A scratch on the arm is a pretty cheap price for that lesson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and Hoederer are both pretty good at keeping your cards close to your chest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather talk about you. High-profile mercenaries like you are pretty much all dead by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've made such big waves in such a short time, but I never heard anything about you before you joined us. That's pretty suspicious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you came looking for Hoederer. Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You said it yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot of people in Kazdel are after his head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You dropped that bomb pretty smoothly. Why'd you change your mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... I figured I'd get what I want easier this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And what is it you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...None of your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're shook. How funny. Why not make something up to dodge the question?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Your Arts again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those damned eyes. My reasons have nothing to do with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Same with my eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...From the east. Something's coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's more than one squad, but only one of them's the real deal. Hmph, they sure are cautious...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehh, sounds like a pretty big gang. Just how many people did they hire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hoederer was right. This is going to be our biggest battle yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're heading into uncharted territory now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "You scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer should be here soon with his squad. Tell the Messenger to get back on comms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember anyone putting you in charge. Don't give me orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oooh, whoopsie...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just keep guarding this campfire over here. I'll head down to the camp and check on the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... Babel's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
